{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01318","headline":"相和歌辞 长门怨 一 · 高蟾","name":"相和歌辞 长门怨 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天上何劳万古春，君前谁是百年人。\n魂销尚媿金炉烬，思起犹慙玉辇尘。\n烟翠薄情攀不得，星芒浮艳采无因。\n可怜明镜来相向，何似恩光朝夕新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高蟾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01318.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01318","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}